        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-31T20:22:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this call just goes down and purges the threadSafeResourceProvider. AFAIK that object doesn\u0027t really hold anything that interesting (maybe just immutable samplers), so things would be very trivially cheap to free from there. Additionally the plan is to get rid of that as we move things to be in a shared ResourceCache.\n\nSo my proposal is that we don\u0027t include this call in the purge duration. By doing that we can move the stop calculation down to a single place in ResourceProvider::purgeResourcesNotUsedSince, and thus don\u0027t need to have this same calculation logic in both Recorder and Context.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 853,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 853,
        "endChar": 75
      },
      "revId": "b4c57bb838a983b8afd09d7232324681b6b4c730",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
