        "id": 18914
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-01T18:34:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am with you w.r.t. the ThreadsafeResourceProvider - done! Added a comment here and in its impl. of resource purging explaining why we do not consider purge time there.\n\nPart of my rationale was keeping this calculation with the purge time calculation. I suppose we could also have the resource provider accept the duration rather than a time, but for now I just moved the stop time calculation and kept the start time one here.",
      "parentUuid": "d6227089_c888d97b",
